{"U_E": 0.0, "U_R": 0.233333, "U_S": 0.75, "absolute_difference": 4.3, "answer_id": "ANS_DM_178", "candidate_reasons": "absolute_disagreement|within_question_outlier", "candidate_threshold": 1.5, "candidate_type": "possible_teacher_under_score", "centered_residual": -4.3, "confounds": "", "corrected_score": "", "extraction_quality": "high", "final_calibrated_score": 6.3, "human_decision": "", "max_score": 10.0, "model_avg_score": 7.3, "outlier_threshold": 1.5, "question_id": "DM_2", "question_median_residual": 0.0, "question_systematic_bias": false, "raw_text": "证明：考证自等价关系则需证。\n①自反性. ∵<a,b>R<c,d>⇔a+b=c+d\n∀a∈A a+a=a+a ⇒<a,a>R<a,a>.\n 得证 \n②对称性. ∵<a,b>R<c,d>⇔a+b=c+d \n故∀a,b∈A a+b=b+a ⇒<a,b>R<b,a> \n得证 \n③传递性. ∵<a,b>R<c,d>⇔a+b=c+d \n故∀a,b,c∈A \na+a=b+b ⇒<a,a>R<b,b>\nb+b=c+c ⇒<b,b>R<c,c>\n ⇒a+a=b+b=c+c.  \n故<a,a>R<c,c> \n得证", "reference_score": 7.3, "reference_score_key": "model_avg_score", "review_note": "", "review_priority": "P1", "route": "BND", "selected_baseline_score": 7.3, "std_dev": 0.6236, "student_image": "data/csbench/student_images/DM_2/ANS_DM_178.jpg", "teacher_minus_reference": -4.3, "teacher_score": 3.0, "three_way_core_score": 6.3}
{"U_E": 0.0, "U_R": 0.0, "U_S": 0.0, "absolute_difference": 3.0, "answer_id": "ANS_DM_114", "candidate_reasons": "absolute_disagreement|within_question_outlier", "candidate_threshold": 1.5, "candidate_type": "possible_teacher_under_score", "centered_residual": -3.0, "confounds": "", "corrected_score": "", "extraction_quality": "high", "final_calibrated_score": 10.0, "human_decision": "", "max_score": 10.0, "model_avg_score": 10.0, "outlier_threshold": 1.5, "question_id": "DM_2", "question_median_residual": 0.0, "question_systematic_bias": false, "raw_text": "证明：∵R是A×A上的二元关系\n①∀<a,b>∈A×A\n<a,b>R<a,b>⇒a+b=b+a\n<c,d>R<d,c>⇒c+d=d+c\n②∀<a,b>,<c,d>∈A×A\n∵<a,b>R<c,d>⇒a+b=c+d\n∴c+d=a+b⇒<a,b>R<c,d>\n③设<a,b>,<c,d>,<e,f>∈A×A.\n∴<a,b>R<c,d>⇒a+b=c+d\n设<c,d>R<e,f>⇒c+d=e+f\n又a+b=c+d=e+f∴a+b=e+f⇒<a,b>R<e,f>\n∴满足自反性,对称性,传递性∴R为等价关系", "reference_score": 10.0, "reference_score_key": "model_avg_score", "review_note": "", "review_priority": "P1", "route": "POS", "selected_baseline_score": 10.0, "std_dev": 0.0, "student_image": "data/csbench/student_images/DM_2/ANS_DM_114.jpg", "teacher_minus_reference": -3.0, "teacher_score": 7.0, "three_way_core_score": 10.0}
{"U_E": 0.0, "U_R": 0.033333, "U_S": 0.0, "absolute_difference": 3.0, "answer_id": "ANS_DM_169", "candidate_reasons": "absolute_disagreement|within_question_outlier", "candidate_threshold": 1.5, "candidate_type": "possible_teacher_under_score", "centered_residual": -3.0, "confounds": "", "corrected_score": "", "extraction_quality": "high", "final_calibrated_score": 10.0, "human_decision": "", "max_score": 10.0, "model_avg_score": 10.0, "outlier_threshold": 1.5, "question_id": "DM_2", "question_median_residual": 0.0, "question_systematic_bias": false, "raw_text": "①自反性: ∀<a,a>∈A×A. ∵a+a=a+a. ∴<a,a>R<a,a>成立, 自反性得证 ②对称性. ∀<a,b>∈A×A. ∵a+b=b+a. ∴<a,b>R<b,a>成立. ∴对称性得证 ③传递性. ∀<a,b>、<c,d>、<e,f>∈A×A. 若<a,b>R<c,d>,则a+b=c+d…(Δ₁) 若<c,d>R<e,f>,则c+d=e+f…(Δ₂). 观察Δ₁与Δ₂式不难发现.a+b=e+f成立 ∴<a,b>R<e,f>成立. ∴对称性得证 \n综上,R是等价关系.", "reference_score": 10.0, "reference_score_key": "model_avg_score", "review_note": "", "review_priority": "P1", "route": "POS", "selected_baseline_score": 10.0, "std_dev": 0.0, "student_image": "data/csbench/student_images/DM_2/ANS_DM_169.jpg", "teacher_minus_reference": -3.0, "teacher_score": 7.0, "three_way_core_score": 10.0}
{"U_E": 0.0, "U_R": 0.333333, "U_S": 1.0, "absolute_difference": 3.0, "answer_id": "ANS_DM_177", "candidate_reasons": "absolute_disagreement|within_question_outlier", "candidate_threshold": 1.5, "candidate_type": "possible_teacher_under_score", "centered_residual": -3.0, "confounds": "", "corrected_score": "", "extraction_quality": "high", "final_calibrated_score": 5.0, "human_decision": "", "max_score": 10.0, "model_avg_score": 6.0, "outlier_threshold": 1.5, "question_id": "DM_2", "question_median_residual": 0.0, "question_systematic_bias": false, "raw_text": "解.\n若R为AxA上等价关系，则R在AxA上同时拥有自反性，对称性和传递性\n自反性: a+b=c+d.\nc+d=a+b.\nb+a=c+d.\n∴满足自反性.\n\n对称性: a+b=c+d.\n-a-c=-c-d.\n∴满足对称性\n\n传递性：设e∈A×A\na+b+e=c+d+e\n∴满足传递性.\n∴R为A×A上等价关系", "reference_score": 6.0, "reference_score_key": "model_avg_score", "review_note": "", "review_priority": "P1", "route": "BND", "selected_baseline_score": 6.0, "std_dev": 0.8165, "student_image": "data/csbench/student_images/DM_2/ANS_DM_177.jpg", "teacher_minus_reference": -3.0, "teacher_score": 3.0, "three_way_core_score": 5.0}
{"U_E": 0.0, "U_R": 0.2, "U_S": 0.75, "absolute_difference": 4.0, "answer_id": "ANS_DM_117", "candidate_reasons": "absolute_disagreement|within_question_outlier", "candidate_threshold": 1.5, "candidate_type": "possible_teacher_over_score", "centered_residual": 4.0, "confounds": "a3wa_changed_score_materially", "corrected_score": "", "extraction_quality": "high", "final_calibrated_score": 3.5, "human_decision": "", "max_score": 10.0, "model_avg_score": 2.0, "outlier_threshold": 1.5, "question_id": "DM_2", "question_median_residual": 0.0, "question_systematic_bias": false, "raw_text": "证：A={1,2,3,4}。\n∀<a,b>,<c,d>∈A×A, <a,b>R<c,d>⇔a+b=c+d 自反性：a=b=c=d时，有<a,a>R<a,a> <b,b>R<b,b> <c,c>R<c,c> <d,d>R<d,d> \n对称性∀a,b. <a,b>R<b,a> \n传递性∀a,b,c,d <a,b>R<b,c>，则a+b=b+c，a=c， 又<b,c>R<c,d>，则b+c=c+d，b=d 有<a,b>R<c,d> \n∴R是等价关系。", "reference_score": 2.0, "reference_score_key": "model_avg_score", "review_note": "", "review_priority": "P2", "route": "BND", "selected_baseline_score": 2.0, "std_dev": 0.7071, "student_image": "data/csbench/student_images/DM_2/ANS_DM_117.jpg", "teacher_minus_reference": 4.0, "teacher_score": 6.0, "three_way_core_score": 3.5}
{"U_E": 0.0, "U_R": 0.133333, "U_S": 1.0, "absolute_difference": 2.5, "answer_id": "ANS_DM_133", "candidate_reasons": "absolute_disagreement|within_question_outlier", "candidate_threshold": 1.5, "candidate_type": "possible_teacher_under_score", "centered_residual": -2.5, "confounds": "unstable_model_judgements", "corrected_score": "", "extraction_quality": "high", "final_calibrated_score": 7.5, "human_decision": "", "max_score": 10.0, "model_avg_score": 7.5, "outlier_threshold": 1.5, "question_id": "DM_2", "question_median_residual": 0.0, "question_systematic_bias": false, "raw_text": "证明①自反性\n∴∀<a,b>,<c,d>∈A×A\n<a,b>R<c,d> ⇔ a+b=c+d\n∴∀<x,y>,<x,y>∈A×A\n则<x,y>R<x,y> ⇔ x+y=x+y\n∴满足自反性\n②对称性\n∀<x,y>,<y,x>∈A×A\n∴<x,y>R<y,x> ⇔ x+y=y+x\n满足对称性\n③传递性\n∀<x,y>,<y,z>,<x,z>∈A×A\n∴<x,y>R<y,z> ⇔ x+y=y+z\n<x,y>R<x,z> ⇔ x+y=x+z\n满足传递性\nAxA={<1,1>,<1,2>,<1,3>,<1,4>,\n<2,1>,<2,2>,<2,3>,<2,4>,\n<3,1>,<3,2>,<3,3>,<3,4>,\n<4,1>,<4,2>,<4,3>,<4,4>,}", "reference_score": 7.5, "reference_score_key": "model_avg_score", "review_note": "", "review_priority": "P2", "route": "BND", "selected_baseline_score": 7.5, "std_dev": 1.0801, "student_image": "data/csbench/student_images/DM_2/ANS_DM_133.jpg", "teacher_minus_reference": -2.5, "teacher_score": 5.0, "three_way_core_score": 7.5}
{"U_E": 0.0, "U_R": 0.133333, "U_S": 0.0, "absolute_difference": 2.0, "answer_id": "ANS_DM_113", "candidate_reasons": "absolute_disagreement|within_question_outlier", "candidate_threshold": 1.5, "candidate_type": "possible_teacher_under_score", "centered_residual": -2.0, "confounds": "", "corrected_score": "", "extraction_quality": "high", "final_calibrated_score": 10.0, "human_decision": "", "max_score": 10.0, "model_avg_score": 10.0, "outlier_threshold": 1.5, "question_id": "DM_2", "question_median_residual": 0.0, "question_systematic_bias": false, "raw_text": "证：\n∀<a,b>,<c,d>∈A×A\n①<a,b>R<a,b>，即a+b=a+b，故满足自反. ②由a+b=b+a，故<a,b>R<b,a>⇔a+b=b+a，故满足对称 ③∀<e,f>∈A×A，若<a,b>R<c,d>∧<c,d>R<e,f>即a+b=c+d，c+d=e+f，故a+b=e+f，故<a,b>R<e,f>⇔a+b=e+f，故R满足传递性. 综上，R为等价关系.", "reference_score": 10.0, "reference_score_key": "model_avg_score", "review_note": "", "review_priority": "P2", "route": "POS", "selected_baseline_score": 10.0, "std_dev": 0.0, "student_image": "data/csbench/student_images/DM_2/ANS_DM_113.jpg", "teacher_minus_reference": -2.0, "teacher_score": 8.0, "three_way_core_score": 10.0}
{"U_E": 0.0, "U_R": 0.0, "U_S": 0.0, "absolute_difference": 2.0, "answer_id": "ANS_DM_131", "candidate_reasons": "absolute_disagreement|within_question_outlier", "candidate_threshold": 1.5, "candidate_type": "possible_teacher_under_score", "centered_residual": -2.0, "confounds": "", "corrected_score": "", "extraction_quality": "high", "final_calibrated_score": 10.0, "human_decision": "", "max_score": 10.0, "model_avg_score": 10.0, "outlier_threshold": 1.5, "question_id": "DM_2", "question_median_residual": 0.0, "question_systematic_bias": false, "raw_text": "证明：①自反性.\n∀<a,b>,<a,b>∈A×A，<a,b>R<a,b>⇔a+b=a+b 成立\n∀<a,a>,<a,a>∈A×A，<a,a>R<a,a>⇔a+a=a+a 成立\n\n②对称性\n∀<a,b>,<b,a>∈A×A，<a,b>R<b,a>⇔a+b=b+a 由加法可交换，成立\n\n③传递性 取a,b,c,d,e,f∈A\n则若<a,b>R<c,d>⇔a+b=c+d ①\n<c,d>R<e,f>⇔c+d=e+f ②\n由①+②得 a+b=e+f\n即<a,b>R<e,f>\n故R可传递\n\n由上R为等价关系", "reference_score": 10.0, "reference_score_key": "model_avg_score", "review_note": "", "review_priority": "P2", "route": "POS", "selected_baseline_score": 10.0, "std_dev": 0.0, "student_image": "data/csbench/student_images/DM_2/ANS_DM_131.jpg", "teacher_minus_reference": -2.0, "teacher_score": 8.0, "three_way_core_score": 10.0}
