{"U_E": 0.0, "U_R": 0.0, "U_S": 0.0, "absolute_difference": 2.0, "answer_id": "ANS_DM_183", "candidate_reasons": "absolute_disagreement|within_question_outlier", "candidate_threshold": 1.5, "candidate_type": "possible_teacher_over_score", "centered_residual": 2.0, "confounds": "", "corrected_score": "", "extraction_quality": "high", "final_calibrated_score": 7.0, "human_decision": "", "max_score": 10.0, "model_avg_score": 7.0, "outlier_threshold": 1.5, "question_id": "DM_2", "question_median_residual": 0.0, "question_systematic_bias": false, "raw_text": "证：<1>自反性. 对∀<a,b>∈A×A ，∵a+b=b+a ∴<b,a>∈A×A ∴可得<a,b>R<b,a>. 满足自反性. \n<2>对称性：对∀<a,b>、<c,d>∈A×A ∵<a,b>R<c,d>⇔a+b=c+d \n又∵a+b=c+d \n∴<c,d>R<a,b>⇔<c,d>R<a,b> ∴由<a,b>R<c,d>→<c,d>R<a,b>,满足对称性. \n<3>传递性：对∀<a,b>、<c,d>、<e,f>∈A×A. 由<a,b>R<c,d>可得:a+b=c+d. \n由<c,d>R<e,f>可得:c+d=e+f \n∴a+b=e+f ∴可得<a,b>R<e,f>. ∴由<a,b>R<c,d>∧<c,d>R<e,f>→<a,b>R<e,f>,满足传递性 ∴综上R是A×A上的等价关系.", "reference_score": 7.0, "reference_score_key": "model_avg_score", "review_note": "", "review_priority": "P2", "route": "POS", "selected_baseline_score": 7.0, "std_dev": 0.0, "student_image": "data/csbench/student_images/DM_2/ANS_DM_183.jpg", "teacher_minus_reference": 2.0, "teacher_score": 9.0, "three_way_core_score": 7.0}
